  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sadie's Cottage at Rosemary Beach ~ Escape to the ultimate beachside paradise at Sadie's Cottage, your dreamy getaway in the heart of Rosemary Beach! This stunning property features room for 14 guests in the main house and an additional 4 in the cozy carriage house—ideal for family get-togethers or fun group retreats. Dive into luxury with your own private pool, outdoor shower, and a fireplace that sets the perfect vibe for s'mores under the stars.<br><br>◾Fall in love with... <br>- Beach Access - private to the Rosemary Beach community. Just 3 min walk to the boardwalk. <br>- 3 levels of living space, plus a carriage house <br>- Private pool with loungers and a waterfall. (with option to heat!)<br>- Walk to your private beach access in 3 min or less. <br>- Outdoor Oasis at your fingertips. Grill, outdoor dining, loungers, and an outdoor fireplace make this a special place. <br>- 4 complimentary bikes to explore the area. <br>- Cozy Balcony spaces. Daybed swing, loungers, and bistro tables. Perfect for cat naps, morning coffee, or soaking up 30A sunshine. <br>- Rosemary Beach. You're in the heart of it all. Steps from Barrett Square's cobblestone streets and European vibes with shopping, dining, great coffee, and green space. <br> - Kitchenette and Laundry Room on 1st and 3rd floor. Great for multiple families to enjoy their own private spaces while still sharing the comfort of this stunning home.<br><br>◾More to love in Rosemary... <br>- Four community pools, including a child-friendly pool with a playground and a covered pool for cooler days. <br>- Fitness trail. This 2-mile trail winds through the community and features four fitness stations along the way. <br>- Get your game on with Tennis at the Raquet Club, or stop by the fitness center for a day, week, or monthly passes (both at additional charge) <br>- Butterfly Garden, stroll through this peaceful space for a moment of relaxation. <br>- Dining spots like Pescado, Gallions, and the rooftop at The Pearl Hotel make Rosemary Beach a sought-after culinary destination. <br><br>✨Step Inside As you enter, you're immediately greeted by a private pool to your left, a spacious outdoor grill and kitchen area, and a cozy fireplace that adds a touch of charm. Twinkle lights set the mood for relaxing after long beach days. <br><br>Once you step through the door, you're welcomed to the ground level, where a relaxing living room with a TV, kitchenette, and laundry room are featured. It's the perfect space for in-laws or an extra family to unwind and enjoy their stay. This floor also features a serene queen bedroom with its own en suite full bathroom—ideal for a week-long retreat. With extra seating, a smart TV, and plenty of storage, this space ensures everyone feels right at home. Additionally, there is a King room as well with an en suite bathroom featuring a walk in shower and double vanity. <br><br>Head upstairs and be wowed by the stunning open living space that awaits! The spacious living room features a cozy fireplace, a large sectional, and a dining area perfect for gathering. Step out onto the roomy deck for a breath of fresh air and stunning views. The chef's kitchen is a true highlight, equipped with a gas range, a sleek chef's island, and a wet bar complete with an ice maker and wine fridge—everything you need to whip up a culinary masterpiece. Vacation mode runs on coffee in this home with both a Keurig and a classic drip coffee maker in the coffee bar. When it's time to dine, gather around the large table with seating for 6, or pull up a seat at the kitchen island, which has space for 4 more. When it's time to rest, the main level also features a King bedroom with an en suite, and bonus: twin daybed swing on the balcony. Nap time is calling! <br><br>Cruise up to the 3rd floor and discover a bonus room on the right, perfect for relaxing or unwinding. This room boasts a pull-out queen sofa, a Smart TV, a kitchenette, and balcony access with beautiful Rosemary views. On the left, get ready for the ultimate kids' paradise—six twin beds arranged in the coziest bunk bed setup you've ever seen! It's the perfect spot for the little ones to crash after a day of fun. The space also shares a full bathroom and a handy bonus laundry room, making everything just a little more convenient. <br><br>Step outside and right in front of the pool, you'll find the charming Carriage House. This cozy retreat comes with a fully equipped kitchen, a laundry area, a comfy living room with a pull-out sofa, and a queen bedroom, sleeping 4. It's the perfect little escape, offering both privacy and easy access to the main home and all its fantastic amenities! <br><br>🛏️Bedrooms in Review ~ <br>1st Floor: King bed with En Suite <br>1st Floor: Queen bed with En Suite <br>2nd Floor Primary: King Bed with En Suite <br>3rd Floor: Bunk room with 6 Twin beds, shared hall bathroom <br>3rd Floor: Bonus room (no door) Pull-out Queen Sofa, shared hall bathroom. <br>Carriage House: Queen bed and Pull-out Queen Sofa <br><br>◾We've got you covered on ~ <br>- Starter kit for everything you'll need: paper towels, toilet paper, linens, towels, dish soap, laundry pods, etc. <br>- Premium bath products. All bathrooms come fully equipped with Public Goods body wash, shampoo, and conditioner <br>- Parking. Available for 2 small vehicles in the garage. <br>- Recommendations - we're always happy to pass along our favorites [hint. hint. Pescado for fine dining, or Cowgirl Kitchen more casual vibes) <br><br>This home is proudly managed by Kalos Dwellings 30A. <br><br>Other things to note:<br>- Parking is available in the garage for 2 small vehicles. There are also open parking spaces next to the garage that are shared within the community. These spaces are first come, first serve. <br>- The word is out! 30A is one of Florida's best vacation spots. Unfortunately, more visitors means less parking options. Additional parking spaces are the responsibility of the renter. We recommend looking into nearby storage facilities who offer long term parking options in their lots.<br>- Minimum age to rent the home is 25.<br>- Golf carts are no permitted in Rosemary Beach.<br>- Apologies, no furry friends are allowed at the home. We appreciate your understanding on this.<br>- Vacation disruptions can be a bummer. While it doesn't happen often, you may experience issues with Wi-Fi or construction on 30A. We are not responsible for any disruptions to the Wi-Fi service or any construction that may affect your experience. Please note that such occurrences are beyond our control, and we appreciate your understanding and patience in these matters.<br>-To note this property does have exterior cameras. They will not be active during your stay. <br><br>ST24-039712",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
